--- 2. GREEDY URGENCY PRIORITISATION ---------------------------
  urgency = 100 * (0.60 * normalised_fill + 0.40 * normalised_age)

  Rank  Bin               Zone   Fill(t)  Age(h)   Urgency
  --------------------------------------------------------
  1     Zone_C_bin           3      4.00    18.0     100.0
  2     Zone_A_bin           1      3.00    14.0      76.1
  3     Zone_B_bin           2      2.50    10.0      59.7
  4     Depot_bin            4      1.50     6.0      35.8

--- 3. CAPACITY-AWARE SELECTION & ROUTING (per truck) ----------

  Truck Truck_Main   (capacity 8.0 t, shift 480 min, start Depot)
    DP knapsack picked 3 bin(s)  ->  load 8.00 t / 8.00 t,   urgency value 195.6
        - Depot_bin       1.50 t   urgency  35.8
        - Zone_B_bin      2.50 t   urgency  59.7
